# Assets live on Cloudflare R2 in production: excluding public/uploads from
# the deployment makes /uploads/* requests fall through to the beforeFiles
# rewrite, which proxies them to the R2 CDN (immutable 1-year cache).
# The files STAY in the repo as the GitHub Actions sync source and for local
# dev (ASSETS_CDN_URL unset → served from public/ as usual).
public/uploads
